<title>SINGAPORE: Venture 1996 net profit surges 67.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Venture 1996 net profit surges 67.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollar unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  36.22   vs    21.58</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    22.90   vs    13.90</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	     4.00   vs     4.00</p>
<p>    Bonus dividend (pct)     4.00   vs     2.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		   649.13   vs   249.52</p>
<p>    Other income		 2.87   vs     1.41</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   1.04   vs     0.76</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	     45.81   vs    25.48</p>
<p>    Tax			   10.03   vs     4.11</p>
<p>    Minorities		   0.45   vs     0.21</p>
<p>Note - Venture Manufacturing (Singapore) Ltd provides manufacturing, engineering and distribution services to the electronics industry.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
